The files under src/generated/ are generated from the ForensicArtifacts
definitions (https://github.com/ForensicArtifacts/artifacts), licensed under
the Apache License, Version 2.0 (LICENSE-APACHE). They are a mechanical
translation of artifacts/data/*.yaml into Rust; each generated file names the
upstream commit it was generated from.

Copyright 2014 The ForensicArtifacts.com Artifact Repository project (see the upstream AUTHORS file).

Modifications: the definitions are generated from a checkout that carries
local commits on top of upstream, adding definitions upstream doesn't have.
Every definition added or changed by this project is marked "Added by this
project" or "Changed by this project" in its generated file, each modified
file says so in its header, and the full list is LOCAL_DEFINITIONS in
src/generated/mod.rs.
